    {
      "heading": "Walkthrough",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Warning: This key section of the article is incomplete. You can help the Guild Wars Wiki by expanding it.",
        "There is a 15 minute time limit for this mission, which is extended by approximately 61 seconds for each boss killed. There are two strategies for extending the time limit:",
        "To cover long distances quickly, bring party-wide speed boosts, e.g. \"Charge!\" or \"Fall Back!\". Remain in the same area and wait for groups to respawn (making sure that there is a boss in the group to extend the time limit). Groups respawn ~2 minutes after being defeated, so you will have to kill 3 or more bosses per cycle in order to extend the timer indefinitely."
      ]
