  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about a mission. This name is also used for an <a href=\"/wiki/Dragon%27s_Throat_(outpost)\" title=\"Dragon&#39;s Throat (outpost)\">outpost</a>&#32;and&#32;an <a href=\"/wiki/Dragon%27s_Throat_(explorable_area)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dragon&#39;s Throat (explorable area)\">explorable area</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#7BC;\">Dragon's Throat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dragon%27s_Throat_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dragon&#39;s Throat map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/5d/Dragon%27s_Throat_map.jpg/250px-Dragon%27s_Throat_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"183\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5d/Dragon%27s_Throat_map.jpg/375px-Dragon%27s_Throat_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/5/5d/Dragon%27s_Throat_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"480\" data-file-height=\"352\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#7BC\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Factions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Factions\">Factions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#7BC;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kaineng_City\" title=\"Kaineng City\">Kaineng City</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#7BC;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Mission\" title=\"Challenge Mission\">Challenge</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#7BC;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dragon's Throat</a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_mission\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Challenge mission\">challenge mission</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Kaineng_City\" title=\"Kaineng City\">Kaineng City</a>. It has become infested with the <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted\" title=\"Afflicted\">Afflicted</a> and declared a health hazard. <a href=\"/wiki/Emperor_Kisu\" title=\"Emperor Kisu\">Emperor Kisu</a> wants all brave <a href=\"/wiki/Cantha\" title=\"Cantha\">Canthans</a> to fight them.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Mission_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mission information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Foes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foes</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Bosses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bosses</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mission_information\">Mission information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Mission information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Kill as many of the afflicted as possible before the timer runs out. Kill an afflicted <a href=\"/wiki/Boss\" title=\"Boss\">boss</a> to gain a time bonus.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>This mission rewards <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">gold</a> based on the formula below. Values are rounded down. Additional bonuses are awarded for beating the daily best, monthly best, or quarterly best scores.\n</p>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border: solid 1px silver; text-align: center; font-size: 90%\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"background: #7BC; font-size: 120%\">\n<th>Reward</th>\n<th>Amount</th>\n<th>Daily Best</th>\n<th>Monthly Best</th>\n<th>Quarterly Best\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background: #7BC;\">Gold\n</th>\n<td>(500 * score) / (Quarterly Best #1 score)</td>\n<td>+500</td>\n<td>+1000</td>\n<td>+2000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"notice metadata\" style=\"padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:10px\"><i>Warning: This key section of the article is incomplete. You can help the Guild Wars Wiki by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//wiki.guildwars.com/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>. </i></div>\n<p>There is a 15 minute time limit for this mission, which is extended by approximately 61 seconds for each boss killed. There are two strategies for extending the time limit:\n</p>\n<ul><li>To cover long distances quickly, bring party-wide speed boosts, e.g. <a href=\"/wiki/%22Charge!%22\" title=\"&quot;Charge!&quot;\">\"Charge!\"</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/%22Fall_Back!%22\" title=\"&quot;Fall Back!&quot;\">\"Fall Back!\"</a>.</li>\n<li>Remain in the same area and wait for groups to respawn (making sure that there is a boss in the group to extend the time limit). Groups respawn ~2 minutes after being defeated, so you will have to kill 3 or more bosses per cycle in order to extend the timer indefinitely.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foes\">Foes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Foes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted\" title=\"Afflicted\">Afflicted</a></dt></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Warrior\" title=\"Afflicted Warrior\">Afflicted Warrior</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Ranger\" title=\"Afflicted Ranger\">Afflicted Ranger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Monk\" title=\"Afflicted Monk\">Afflicted Monk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Necromancer\" title=\"Afflicted Necromancer\">Afflicted Necromancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Mesmer\" title=\"Afflicted Mesmer\">Afflicted Mesmer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Elementalist\" title=\"Afflicted Elementalist\">Afflicted Elementalist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Assassin\"><img alt=\"Assassin\" src=\"/images/5/5f/Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Assassin\" title=\"Afflicted Assassin\">Afflicted Assassin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Ritualist\" title=\"Afflicted Ritualist\">Afflicted Ritualist</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bosses\">Bosses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Bosses\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted\" title=\"Afflicted\">Afflicted</a></dt></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 (30) <a href=\"/wiki/The_Afflicted_Tamaya\" title=\"The Afflicted Tamaya\">The Afflicted Tamaya</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Enraged_Smash\" title=\"Enraged Smash\">Enraged Smash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 (30) <a href=\"/wiki/The_Afflicted_Susei\" title=\"The Afflicted Susei\">The Afflicted Susei</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Broad_Head_Arrow\" title=\"Broad Head Arrow\">Broad Head Arrow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 (30) <a href=\"/wiki/The_Afflicted_Cho\" title=\"The Afflicted Cho\">The Afflicted Cho</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Judgment\" title=\"Ray of Judgment\">Ray of Judgment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 (30) <a href=\"/wiki/The_Afflicted_Xi\" title=\"The Afflicted Xi\">The Afflicted Xi</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_Apostasy\" title=\"Order of Apostasy\">Order of Apostasy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 (30) <a href=\"/wiki/The_Afflicted_Meeka\" title=\"The Afflicted Meeka\">The Afflicted Meeka</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Stolen_Speed\" title=\"Stolen Speed\">Stolen Speed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 (30) <a href=\"/wiki/The_Afflicted_Rasa\" title=\"The Afflicted Rasa\">The Afflicted Rasa</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Burn\" title=\"Mind Burn\">Mind Burn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Assassin\"><img alt=\"Assassin\" src=\"/images/5/5f/Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 (30) <a href=\"/wiki/The_Afflicted_Huu\" title=\"The Afflicted Huu\">The Afflicted Huu</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Form\" title=\"Shadow Form\">Shadow Form</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 (30) <a href=\"/wiki/The_Afflicted_Mei\" title=\"The Afflicted Mei\">The Afflicted Mei</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_of_Quickening\" title=\"Weapon of Quickening\">Weapon of Quickening</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dragon%27s_Throat&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>As with all challenge missions, foes do not drop items when killed.</li>\n<li>After 30 minutes, players will suffer from <a href=\"/wiki/Extensive_Plague_Exposure\" title=\"Extensive Plague Exposure\">Extensive Plague Exposure</a>.</li>\n<li>Enemies aren't <a href=\"/wiki/Resurrect\" title=\"Resurrect\">resurrected</a>, but new ones are spawned. This means that each boss killed will give an additional <a href=\"/wiki/Morale_boost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Morale boost\">morale boost</a> and leave an additional corpse.</li>\n<li>Some bosses will spawn in multiple locations.<sup style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">[<a href=\"/wiki/Talk:Dragon%27s_Throat\" title=\"Talk:Dragon&#39;s Throat\"><span title=\"they may also leash from across the map, further testing is needed\"><i>verification requested</i></span></a>]</sup></li>\n<li>It is possible to kill enemies before the start of the mission, if they patrol close enough to the gate. These kills do not count towards your score, but will be respawned as normal.</li>\n<li>The bosses in this mission respawn after being defeated; the death of respawned bosses still adds time to the mission timer.</li>\n<li>Scores were previously kept on a leaderboard on the official guildwars.com site. <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\">&#91;1&#93;</a></sup></li>\n<li>The Afflicted Mei will despawn immediately after spawning.</li>\n<li>Killing a boss may not grant additional time.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"stdt\" style=\"margin: 5px auto; border: 1px solid #C0C0C0; font-size: 90%; width: 80%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background: #7BC; font-size: 110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Factions_missions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Factions missions\">Factions missions</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Minister_Cho%27s_Estate\" title=\"Minister Cho&#39;s Estate\">Minister Cho's Estate</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Zen_Daijun\" title=\"Zen Daijun\">Zen Daijun</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Vizunah_Square\" title=\"Vizunah Square\">Vizunah Square</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Nahpui_Quarter\" title=\"Nahpui Quarter\">Nahpui Quarter</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Tahnnakai_Temple\" title=\"Tahnnakai Temple\">Tahnnakai Temple</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Arborstone\" title=\"Arborstone\">Arborstone</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Boreas_Seabed\" title=\"Boreas Seabed\">Boreas Seabed</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Sunjiang_District\" title=\"Sunjiang District\">Sunjiang District</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Gyala_Hatchery\" title=\"Gyala Hatchery\">Gyala Hatchery</a> <i>or</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Eternal_Grove\" title=\"The Eternal Grove\">The Eternal Grove</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Unwaking_Waters\" title=\"Unwaking Waters\">Unwaking Waters</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Raisu_Palace\" title=\"Raisu Palace\">Raisu Palace</a>&#160;» <a href=\"/wiki/Imperial_Sanctum\" title=\"Imperial Sanctum\">Imperial Sanctum</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_mission\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Challenge mission\">Challenge</a></b></i><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Altrumm_Ruins\" title=\"Altrumm Ruins\">Altrumm Ruins</a> <span style=\"margin: 0em 0.3em;\">•</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amatz_Basin\" title=\"Amatz Basin\">Amatz Basin</a> <span style=\"margin: 0em 0.3em;\">•</span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Aurios_Mines\" title=\"The Aurios Mines\">The Aurios Mines</a> <span style=\"margin: 0em 0.3em;\">•</span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dragon's Throat</a> <span style=\"margin: 0em 0.3em;\">•</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zos_Shivros_Channel\" title=\"Zos Shivros Channel\">Zos Shivros Channel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Competitive_mission\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Competitive mission\">Competitive</a></b></i><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Fort_Aspenwood\" title=\"Fort Aspenwood\">Fort Aspenwood</a> <span style=\"margin: 0em 0.3em;\">•</span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Jade_Quarry\" title=\"The Jade Quarry\">The Jade Quarry</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Elite_mission\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elite mission\">Elite</a></b></i><br /><a href=\"/wiki/The_Deep\" title=\"The Deep\">The Deep</a> <span style=\"margin: 0em 0.3em;\">•</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Urgoz%27s_Warren\" title=\"Urgoz&#39;s Warren\">Urgoz's Warren</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b> <span class=\"reference-text\">An archive of the leaderboard is available at \n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070515190218/http://www.guildwars.com/competitive/challenge_mission_ladder/default.php\">archive.org</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009131547\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 788/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6219/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 672/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 89/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.690      1 -total\n 42.90%   32.043      1 Template:Location_disambiguation_2\n 20.98%   15.674      8 Template:Ifexists\n 11.24%    8.397      1 Template:Mission_infobox\n  6.43%    4.799      1 Template:Factions_missions\n  5.40%    4.032      2 Template:W\n  4.03%    3.007      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n  3.97%    2.966      1 Template:Section-stub\n  3.69%    2.756      1 Template:Verify\n  3.68%    2.746      8 Template:Profession_icon_sizes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:12687-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009131547 and revision id 2721632.\n -->\n</div>"
